{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747520/extras/3fb40487e0773d2b2d66bef369effd34.avif?t=1766180511\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747520/extras_big/3fb40487e0773d2b2d66bef369effd34.avif?t=1766180511 width=800 height=362 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What do You Call a Group of Skeletons</strong> is a short comedy puzzle adventure featuring a <i>(you guessed it)</i> group of skeletons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a part of the Mobile Milk Brigade, a group of anarchistic skeletons looking for hip new sources of calcium. Your journey has led you to &quot;<i>the Hospital</i>&quot;, where Craig the great inventor and famous skeleton denier has been living in recluse for many years.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you convince Craig to give up his unfinished milk supplement?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747520/extras/a377556fa41e66927da54ea42be62e64.avif?t=1766180511\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747520/extras_big/a377556fa41e66927da54ea42be62e64.avif?t=1766180511 width=800 height=362 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Mobile Milk Brigade is a colourful cast of characters, including your long time friend Wrangler Bones, the ever profit driven Money Bones, and many more. In between exploring sessions you will get the chance to talk to them and learn more about the world and story as it progresses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747520/extras/c6c93060e9426f8634f20fe0533b6e07.avif?t=1766180511\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747520/extras_big/c6c93060e9426f8634f20fe0533b6e07.avif?t=1766180511 width=800 height=362 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Hospital is a strange collection of rooms and corridors that lead nowhere, with puzzles scattered across blocking your way. You will need <strong>arms</strong>, <strong>brains</strong>, and <strong>guts</strong> to beat it all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747520/extras/3faea2a6d027c860ac0f2103bd7424d1.avif?t=1766180511\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747520/extras_big/3faea2a6d027c860ac0f2103bd7424d1.avif?t=1766180511 width=800 height=362 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The pinnacle of all collectibles, and driving force of everyone's daily motivation!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"A mild amount of tomfoolery.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3747520/16e5186edd4e41168b9a54041c6216814b43f6d8.jpg"}],"total":1},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3747520?t=1766180511","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747520/cbbe995fa46e82a74841d12945dba1f53a8c8867/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1766180511","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747520/0d3adddfabb8b7f99c47cc7650c9456bf8b1cb39/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766180511","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747520/0d3adddfabb8b7f99c47cc7650c9456bf8b1cb39/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766180511","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3826430,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>What do You Call a Group of Skeletons is a pilot!</h1><p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Pilot? For a video game?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We overestimated how much content we could get done in a year, so we made the decision to turn the game into a pilot. Our team consists entirely of  newcomers to the industry, and this has been our first project for the public market. Working on this game has been an invaluable learning experience for us and we are immensely proud of what we have created, but we also want to make sure you know what you are getting in to!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > This game features<strong> two levels</strong>\u00a0and serves as a <strong>proof of concept</strong> of the kind of game we'd like to make in the future.<strong> The story is  not complete, and ends on a cliffhanger</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you enjoyed the game, we'd love to hear from you! And if you didn't, we want to hear that too. Feedback is very important for us to be able to make the best possible version of this game when we can revisit it one day. Knowing that there is interest in this game or a game like it helps us when pitching the game to publishers or investors as well.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arctic Bones isn't going away</strong>! There are games we want to make and stories we want to tell, but for now\u00a0<i>What do You Call a Group of Skeletons</i>\u00a0will be left here.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747520/extras/3fb40487e0773d2b2d66bef369effd34.avif?t=1766180511\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747520/extras_big/3fb40487e0773d2b2d66bef369effd34.avif?t=1766180511 width=800 height=362 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What do You Call a Group of Skeletons</strong> is a short comedy puzzle adventure featuring a <i>(you guessed it)</i> group of skeletons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a part of the Mobile Milk Brigade, a group of anarchistic skeletons looking for hip new sources of calcium. Your journey has led you to &quot;<i>the Hospital</i>&quot;, where Craig the great inventor and famous skeleton denier has been living in recluse for many years.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you convince Craig to give up his unfinished milk supplement?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747520/extras/a377556fa41e66927da54ea42be62e64.avif?t=1766180511\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747520/extras_big/a377556fa41e66927da54ea42be62e64.avif?t=1766180511 width=800 height=362 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Mobile Milk Brigade is a colourful cast of characters, including your long time friend Wrangler Bones, the ever profit driven Money Bones, and many more. In between exploring sessions you will get the chance to talk to them and learn more about the world and story as it progresses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747520/extras/c6c93060e9426f8634f20fe0533b6e07.avif?t=1766180511\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747520/extras_big/c6c93060e9426f8634f20fe0533b6e07.avif?t=1766180511 width=800 height=362 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Hospital is a strange collection of rooms and corridors that lead nowhere, with puzzles scattered across blocking your way. You will need <strong>arms</strong>, <strong>brains</strong>, and <strong>guts</strong> to beat it all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747520/extras/3faea2a6d027c860ac0f2103bd7424d1.avif?t=1766180511\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747520/extras_big/3faea2a6d027c860ac0f2103bd7424d1.avif?t=1766180511 width=800 height=362 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The pinnacle of all collectibles, and driving force of everyone's daily motivation!</p>","developers":["Arctic Bones"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747520/c023e4b46921b96cdb3f22a56f995c23b6af0809/header.jpg?t=1766180511","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3747520/1408526860/fa6b41d3354bc1246d6cc83b11c338915d058d1d/1759933612/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759934518","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3747520/1408526860/fa6b41d3354bc1246d6cc83b11c338915d058d1d/1759933612/dash_h264.mpd?t=1759934518","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3747520/1408526860/fa6b41d3354bc1246d6cc83b11c338915d058d1d/1759933612/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1759934518","id":257214313,"name":"Demo Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai